        175.14138793945312
      ],
      "text": "guidelines on tuberculosis – Module 6",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 25.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.4244995117188,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "Globally, tuberculosis (TB) remains a significant cause of ill health and is a leading cause of death due",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4214477539062,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "to an infectious agent  . Five main health-related risk factors, namely, diabetes mellitus (diabetes),  (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4442138671875,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "HIV, smoking, undernutrition and disorders due to alcohol use, account collectively for just under",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.3849487304688,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "half of all new TB episodes globally. The contribution of these risk factors to the global TB burden is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.430419921875,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "reported annually in the WHO’s  . For the purpose of these consolidated  Global tuberculosis report (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.4177856445312,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "guidelines, a health-related risk factor is defined as a condition or action that increases the risk of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4129028320312,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "disease  . Other significant health-related risk factors for TB disease include silicosis and disorders  (2)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4463500976562,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "due to drug use. When they occur in people with TB, health-related risk factors are also considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4100952148438,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "comorbidities, and may lead to poor TB treatment outcomes, lower health-related quality of life, or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4135131835938,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "other suboptimal health or social outcomes, such as increased out-of-pocket costs or TB-associated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        494.89532470703125,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "disabilities. The impact of these risk factors for TB differs between and even within countries.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.3992309570312,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "People with TB also frequently experience other comorbidities, including pulmonary and mental",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4395141601562,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "health conditions, and viral hepatitis  . Moreover, people with TB may develop chronic lung disease  (2)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.442138671875,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "or other impairments (for example musculoskeletal or neurological impairments), all of which require",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        524.4061279296875,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "specialized care or rehabilitation during TB treatment and after TB treatment completion. Health-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4102172851562,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "related risk factors and TB comorbidities require holistic people-centred care in the context of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        193.26531982421875,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "universal health coverage.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4288940429688,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Addressing individual comorbidities, multimorbidity, TB-associated disabilities and health-related risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        524.4111938476562,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "factors for TB are key elements of the WHO  , which focuses on integrated patient- End TB strategy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4190673828125,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "centred care and prevention  . The   emphasizes that relevant comorbidities and  (3) End TB strategy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.4378662109375,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "health-related risk factors should be routinely assessed and managed for improved TB treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        535.3824462890625,
        207.8271942138672,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and general health outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.415771484375,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The political declaration of the 2023 United Nations (UN) High-Level Meeting on the fight against",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.431396484375,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "TB   reaffirmed the commitment to ending the TB epidemic globally by 2030, in line with the  (4)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4146118164062,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Sustainable Development Goals. In the declaration, Member States committed to integrating services",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4136962890625,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "for TB, HIV and other comorbidities within primary health care, and to strengthening coordination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4367065429688,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "and collaboration between programmes, to ensure universal access to integrated prevention,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.447509765625,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis, treatment and care for TB, HIV and other comorbidities. Member States also committed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.4234619140625,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "to three key targets by 2027: a) at least 90% of the estimated number of people who develop TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4058227539062,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "are reached with quality assured diagnosis and treatment; b) at least 90% of all people at high-risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.402587890625,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of developing TB are provided with preventive treatment, including approximately 15 million people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4255981445312,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV, and c) all people with TB have access to a health and social benefits package so",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        703.3823852539062,
        524.4102172851562,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "they do not have to endure financial hardship because of their illness  . In the latest UN High- (4)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.406982421875,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Level Meeting declarations on HIV   and on Universal Health Coverage in 2021 and 2023,  (5)  (6)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        731.3823852539062,
        527.435546875,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "respectively, Member States also committed to assuring integrated people-centred services for TB,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        745.3823852539062,
        306.0792236328125,
        759.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "HIV, noncommunicable diseases and mental health.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
